==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/haiː/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|aiː|lang=is}}

===Interjection===
{{head|is|interjection}}

# [[hi]]

====Usage notes====
The use of {{m|is|hæ}} and {{m|is|bæ}} (corresponding to English {{m|en|hi}} and {{m|en|bye}}, respectively) is often frowned upon, especially among older people. The greetings {{m|is|sæll}} and {{m|is|blessaður}} (both of course declined in terms of gender and number) and/or the undeclined (and slightly less formal) {{m|is|bless}} should be used instead.

